From: OpenTina <opentina@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: bump cmake_minimum_required to 3.5

Buildroot host-cmake is 4.x, which refuses projects that declare a
minimum below 3.5. Upstream optee_examples raised this in 4.8.0; keep
the same one-line fix while we stay on the 4.6.0 pin.

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required (VERSION 3.2)
+cmake_minimum_required (VERSION 3.5)
 project (optee_examples C)
 
 # https://cmake.org/Wiki/CMake_Useful_Variables
